    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that asBitMapArray correctly splits set bits across multiple longs. Setup: IncrementingHasher(63, 1) with k=2 sets bits at indices 63 and 64. - Bit 63 is the most-significant bit of the first long → 0x8000000000000000L - Bit 64 is the least-significant bit of the second long → 0x1L A shape of 72 bits spans two longs (bits 0-63 and bits 64-71), so the returned array must have exactly 2 elements."
   },
